eply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Can we get people to have more babies by emphasizing the importance of having babies?\n\nNope. @PeterRFB @DrJasonCarroll and I found that while people who personally see sources of enjoyment and meaning in kids tend to have more, obligations to have kids don't move the needle. https://t.co/jrzAMBdeeB","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112602205979025837"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:28:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112596736531157267"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"link.springer.com/content/pdf/10…","end":148,"expanded_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s10887-026-09273-x.pdf","start":125,"status":303,"unwound_url":"https://idp.springer.com/authorize?response_type=cookie&client_id=springerlink&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fcontent%2Fpdf%2F10.1007%2Fs10887-026-09273-x.pdf%3F","url":"https://t.co/IJolDFzzu5"}]},"id":"2112596736531157267","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":1932,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"text":"this paper finally came out! very cool work showing that economic volatility reduces fertility, not just economic bad times! https://t.co/IJolDFzzu5","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112596736531157267"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112594945894674434","3_2112595099448115200"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:21:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112595132172108143"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":146,"id":"1600613745453158401","start":135,"username":"MoreBirths"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"link.springer.com/content/pdf/10…","end":235,"expanded_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1186/s41118-026-00299-y_reference.pdf","start":212,"unwound_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1186/s41118-026-00299-y_reference.pdf?error=cookies_not_supported&code=0a7c4cfd-517c-41af-94ef-c05d57618b1a","url":"https://t.co/S5gNBy17hq"},{"display_url